    {
      "id": "A1-06-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: Is it ...? / Are they ...? (yes / no questions with be)",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "Is it a goat? Yes, it is. Is it a cow? No, it is not. Are they sheep? Yes, they are. Are they horses? No, they are not."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "لنسأل سؤال «نعم/لا» بالإنجليزية **نقدّم الفعل be** على الفاعل:\n\n- It **is** a goat. → **Is** it a goat? (هل هو ماعز؟)\n- They **are** sheep. → **Are** they sheep? (هل هم غنم؟)\n\nنجيب إجابة قصيرة:\n- **Yes, it is.** / **No, it isn't.** (it is not)\n- **Yes, they are.** / **No, they aren't.** (they are not)\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** أن نرفع النغمة فقط ونقول «It is a goat?». الصحيح تقديم الفعل: **Is it a goat?**\n\n**ملاحظة:** كلمة sheep مفرد وجمع بنفس الشكل: one sheep, two sheep."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "الجملة الخبرية",
            "السؤال",
            "الجواب"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "It is a goat.",
              "Is it a goat?",
              "Yes, it is."
            ],
            [
              "It is not a cow.",
              "Is it a cow?",
              "No, it isn't."
            ],
            [
              "They are sheep.",
              "Are they sheep?",
              "Yes, they are."
            ],
            [
              "They are not horses.",
              "Are they horses?",
              "No, they aren't."
            ]
          ]
        },
